    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/b39a4802a6060e4ed4e092907165ed17.webp?t=1751613646\" width=164 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn your seeds and insects into the environment. Watch your plants and populations grow on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/af00b990e09bb5815c74cf235a3ad6f0.webp?t=1751613646\" width=186 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new species and introduce them into an increasingly complex micro ecosystem with symbiosis, predators and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/dd21758618a2863db15c22477abb7a37.webp?t=1751613646\" width=200 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe how simple interactions lead to emergent behavior such as trails of ants, swarms of flies, shapes of plants and dynamics of populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/6c75ff4c3795b1bfa00ec33c81e68066.webp?t=1751613646\" width=194 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare an ecosystem with enough diversity to defend against infestations that might threaten your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/352c08f50567170213b1cf7ba40ec849.webp?t=1751613646\" width=200 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your spawn order, timing and location to recover from infestations faster as a bonus challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/b39a4802a6060e4ed4e092907165ed17.webp?t=1751613646\" width=164 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn your seeds and insects into the environment. Watch your plants and populations grow on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/af00b990e09bb5815c74cf235a3ad6f0.webp?t=1751613646\" width=186 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new species and introduce them into an increasingly complex micro ecosystem with symbiosis, predators and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/dd21758618a2863db15c22477abb7a37.webp?t=1751613646\" width=200 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe how simple interactions lead to emergent behavior such as trails of ants, swarms of flies, shapes of plants and dynamics of populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/6c75ff4c3795b1bfa00ec33c81e68066.webp?t=1751613646\" width=194 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare an ecosystem with enough diversity to defend against infestations that might threaten your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679320/extras/352c08f50567170213b1cf7ba40ec849.webp?t=1751613646\" width=200 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your spawn order, timing and location to recover from infestations faster as a bonus challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Phero is a small-scale nature simulation game where you grow flowers, gather nectar and balance an ecosystem. Introduce different insects species, observe them interact and stay on top of the food chain to prepare your plants for infestations.",
